; n88basic-check.js is committed so the extension needs no build step at
; install time (see editor/vscode/README.md). `dune build` still regenerates
; it from editor/lsp/ and, via (mode promote), copies the result back over
; this file whenever the compiled checker changes -- so it is generated, not
; hand-maintained, without asking the editor's users to run a JS build tool.
(rule
 (mode promote)
 (target n88basic-check.js)
 (deps ../../lsp/js_main.bc.js)
 (action
  (copy ../../lsp/js_main.bc.js n88basic-check.js)))
